# The wheel builder and the build backend pyproject.toml names. CI builds
# the wheel with `python -m build --no-isolation` and installs the project
# with `--no-build-isolation`, both over this set, so neither downloads an
# unverified backend. Compiled into requirements-build.txt with hashes on
# Python 3.11, for the reason requirements-dev.in gives; --allow-unsafe
# because setuptools is the point:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe requirements-build.in
build
setuptools
